'''Quivers''' are a [[item class|class of item]]s that can be [[Equipment|equipped]] in the [[off-hand]] slot while using a [[bow]]. Quivers are disabled and unequippable if a bow is not equipped.

Most quivers do not come with gem [[socket]]s. The exception is {{il|Ornate Quiver}}, which gains one socket from its [[implicit modifier]].

